================ 0. 空店重置 ================
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 清场
  POST /admin/reset  body={}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "reset": true
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
================ 1. 普通小单：一次三份，只改其中一份 ================
  三份独立菜单：M0001 M0002 M0003
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 只把第二份 M0002 改成免葱（另两份不动）
  POST /slips/modify  body={"slip_id":"M0002","new_prep":"干炒牛河-免葱"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "slip_id": "M0002",
    "prep": "干炒牛河-免葱"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 撤掉第三份 M0003（未喊炒，直接作废）
  POST /slips/cancel  body={"slip_id":"M0003"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "slip_id": "M0003",
    "status": "CANCELLED",
    "leftover_plates": 0
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 炒档拉队列看剩余待炒
  GET /queue?prep=%E5%B9%B2%E7%82%92%E7%89%9B%E6%B2%B3-%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86 
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "queue": [
      {
        "id": "M0001",
        "diner_id": "D001",
        "prep": "干炒牛河-标准",
        "status": "ENTERED",
        "qty": 1,
        "note": null,
        "revised_from": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-26T03:37:31+00:00",
        "table_name": "己桌",
        "diner_name": "己"
      }
    ]
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
================ 2. 食客换桌：锅里已喊的份不能少 ================
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 喊炒 -> 锅 W0001 钉住这份菜单 M0004
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 庚换到辛桌（菜还在锅里，份跟着人走）
  POST /diners/move  body={"diner_id":"D002","to_table":"辛桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "diner_id": "D002",
    "table": "辛桌"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 这锅报熟
  POST /wok/finish  body={"wok_id":"W0001"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok_id": "W0001",
    "plates": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0001",
        "slip_id": "M0004",
        "status": "READY"
      }
    ],
    "shorted": []
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 按辛桌派盘（旧庚桌派不出去）
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0001","table":"辛桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0001",
    "plate_id": "P0001",
    "table": "辛桌",
    "diner_id": "D002",
    "slip_id": "M0004",
    "prep": "豉油皇炒面-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 若仍报庚桌 -> 应当 409
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0001","table":"庚桌"}
{
  "ok": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "PLATE_TAKEN",
    "message": "P0001 已派给 辛桌 桌",
    "delivery_id": "V0001",
    "table": "辛桌"
  }
}
[HTTP 409]
================ 3. 午市主场景：甲乙同做法一锅，甲撤单，丙加入 ================
  甲=M0005 乙=M0006
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 炒档把两份同锅喊炒（每份钉菜单号）-> 锅 W0002
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 甲撤单 —— 锅里那份撤不掉，熟后按余菜处理
  POST /slips/cancel  body={"slip_id":"M0005"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "slip_id": "M0005",
    "status": "CANCELLED",
    "leftover_plates": 0
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 丙此时点同款（此锅已满，丙单 M0007 进队列等下一锅）
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 照单结这锅：两份都真炒出来，甲那份起锅即余菜
  POST /wok/finish  body={"wok_id":"W0002"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok_id": "W0002",
    "plates": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0002",
        "slip_id": "M0005",
        "status": "LEFTOVER"
      },
      {
        "plate_id": "P0003",
        "slip_id": "M0006",
        "status": "READY"
      }
    ],
    "shorted": []
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 传菜查 W0002 的盘号来路（portion 钉菜单、盘钉 portion）
  GET /wok/W0002 
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok": {
      "id": "W0002",
      "prep": "豉油皇炒面-标准",
      "status": "DONE",
      "created_at": "2026-11-26T03:37:31+00:00",
      "done_at": "2026-11-26T03:37:31+00:00"
    },
    "portions": [
      {
        "portion_id": 2,
        "status": "COOKED",
        "slip_id": "M0005",
        "diner_id": "D003",
        "slip_status": "CANCELLED",
        "plate_id": "P0002",
        "plate_status": "LEFTOVER"
      },
      {
        "portion_id": 3,
        "status": "COOKED",
        "slip_id": "M0006",
        "diner_id": "D004",
        "slip_status": "WOK_LOCKED",
        "plate_id": "P0003",
        "plate_status": "READY"
      }
    ]
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
  甲的盘=P0002（余菜） 乙的盘=P0003（待派）
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 余菜想再派出去 -> 409 余菜不可派
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0002","table":"甲桌"}
{
  "ok": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "LEFTOVER_NOT_DELIVERABLE",
    "message": "P0002 是余菜，不能派盘"
  }
}
[HTTP 409]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 乙的盘派到乙桌
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0003","table":"乙桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0002",
    "plate_id": "P0003",
    "table": "乙桌",
    "diner_id": "D004",
    "slip_id": "M0006",
    "prep": "豉油皇炒面-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 乙已上桌后撤单 -> 409 已派盘不能退款
  POST /slips/cancel  body={"slip_id":"M0006"}
{
  "ok": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "ALREADY_DELIVERED",
    "message": "M0006 已派盘上桌，撤单不能退款"
  }
}
[HTTP 409]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 丙的单单独喊炒 -> 锅 W0003
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 报熟
  POST /wok/finish  body={"wok_id":"W0003"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok_id": "W0003",
    "plates": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0004",
        "slip_id": "M0007",
        "status": "READY"
      }
    ],
    "shorted": []
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 派给丙桌
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0004","table":"丙桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0003",
    "plate_id": "P0004",
    "table": "丙桌",
    "diner_id": "D005",
    "slip_id": "M0007",
    "prep": "豉油皇炒面-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 余菜清单（甲那份在此，不可重派）
  GET /leftovers 
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "leftovers": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0002",
        "wok_id": "W0002",
        "origin_slip_id": "M0005",
        "prep": "豉油皇炒面-标准",
        "diner_id": "D003",
        "table_name": "甲桌"
      }
    ]
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
