}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0006","table":"丁桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0005",
    "plate_id": "P0006",
    "table": "丁桌",
    "diner_id": "D006",
    "slip_id": "M0009",
    "prep": "星洲炒米-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
--- 试 1：乙临时改免葱，而锅里已经有葱 -> 原锅不能给乙这份 ---
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 喊炒并报熟（葱已下锅）-> 锅 W0005
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 
  POST /wok/finish  body={"wok_id":"W0005"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok_id": "W0005",
    "plates": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0007",
        "slip_id": "M0010",
        "status": "READY"
      },
      {
        "plate_id": "P0008",
        "slip_id": "M0011",
        "status": "READY"
      }
    ],
    "shorted": []
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 乙这时改免葱 -> 旧单留锅转余菜，另开免葱新单等下一锅
  POST /slips/revise  body={"slip_id":"M0010","new_prep":"干炒牛河-免葱"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "old_slip_id": "M0010",
    "old_slip_status": "CANCELLED",
    "leftover_plates": 1,
    "new_slip_id": "M0012",
    "new_prep": "干炒牛河-免葱",
    "explanation": "这份已喊炒并下锅，原锅不能给改后的做法；熟品转余菜，新单等下一锅炒"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 原锅那盘再想派给乙 -> 409 余菜不可派
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0007","table":"乙桌"}
{
  "ok": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "LEFTOVER_NOT_DELIVERABLE",
    "message": "P0007 是余菜，不能派盘"
  }
}
[HTTP 409]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 壬的盘照派
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0008","table":"壬桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0006",
    "plate_id": "P0008",
    "table": "壬桌",
    "diner_id": "D007",
    "slip_id": "M0011",
    "prep": "干炒牛河-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 免葱新单在队列里（下一锅才轮到）
