================ 6. 客户端丢回应：幂等键重连查回同一次派盘 ================
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 成锅报熟 -> 锅 W0008
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 
  POST /wok/finish  body={"wok_id":"W0008"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "wok_id": "W0008",
    "plates": [
      {
        "plate_id": "P0011",
        "slip_id": "M0016",
        "status": "READY"
      }
    ],
    "shorted": []
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 第一次派盘（回应在网络上丢了）
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0011","table":"寅桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0009",
    "plate_id": "P0011",
    "table": "寅桌",
    "diner_id": "D011",
    "slip_id": "M0016",
    "prep": "雪菜肉丝面-标准"
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
──────────────────────────────────────────────
▸ 客户端重连，带同一幂等键重试 -> 同一 delivery，不产生第二笔
  POST /plates/deliver  body={"plate_id":"P0011","table":"寅桌"}
{
  "ok": true,
  "data": {
    "delivery_id": "V0009",
    "plate_id": "P0011",
    "table": "寅桌",
    "diner_id": "D011",
    "slip_id": "M0016",
    "prep": "雪菜肉丝面-标准",
    "idempotent_replay": true
  }
}
[HTTP 200]
